sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant XGenerateTransactionInvoice
    participant Database

    Client->>+XGenerateTransactionInvoice: POST /api/v1/transaction-invoices/generate
    XGenerateTransactionInvoice->>XGenerateTransactionInvoice: Validate InvoiceAmount > 0
    XGenerateTransactionInvoice->>XGenerateTransactionInvoice: Validate InvoiceDate >= Today
    XGenerateTransactionInvoice->>XGenerateTransactionInvoice: Validate AccountCategoryId not empty
    XGenerateTransactionInvoice->>+Database: SELECT AccountCategory WHERE Id = @id
    Database-->>-XGenerateTransactionInvoice: AccountCategory (balance, peg)
    XGenerateTransactionInvoice->>XGenerateTransactionInvoice: Check balance < peg amount?
    alt Balance below peg
        XGenerateTransactionInvoice->>+Database: INSERT TransactionInvoice + CashInOut
        Database-->>-XGenerateTransactionInvoice: Saved (invoiceId, cashInOutId)
        XGenerateTransactionInvoice-->>Client: 200 OK { result: "invoice created", invoiceId }
    else Balance at or above peg
        XGenerateTransactionInvoice-->>Client: 200 OK { result: "not needed" }
    end
